 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"My wound needs a second pair of hands. Could you take a look?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "Another crack. The telling doesn't hold together anymore."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "Their voice loosens. The guardedness thins."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"Okay. I'll manage on my own.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"Please — whatever this is, it's getting worse — I'm feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. I need help. Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"The cut's gone hot and it's spreading — I can feel it moving. Clean it out, wrap it tight, please. Before it turns.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "Another pass over the same ground. Somebody's being careful. Careful people leave cleaner trails — and cleaner trails are still trails."
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"They're already drifting away. \"Later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 11,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about that favor — we got cut off, 4 days back. 'Anyway — I should get going.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"It's already handled. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "You show them Jerusalem Artichoke — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Huh? Oh!\" Carmen looks genuinely confused, then it clicks. \"No — I see why you'd think that. Here's what actually happened...\" The explanation holds together."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"No — you're right, it's a lot. Forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"About the sickness I'm fighting — still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Rest won't touch this. The heat's climbing and my head's full of cotton. Someone who knows what they're doing — please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"The whole fire was arguing about Highbeam Deer last night — what to even CALL it. 'The Bright Bastard' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Okay. That's — I need a minute. A long minute.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Chester keeps their voice low. \"The stores. Have you looked at the stores? We're running thin.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"I dreamed Miguel was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Miguel's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"...I need to go be quiet for a while.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "«¿Qué lugar es este? ¿Dónde estamos?» \"Water?\" — they grin, proud of the one English they know."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "«Eso mismo. Diste en el clavo.» — Ella translates: \"That's it. You hit the nail on the head.\" They nod back, slowly."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "«No lo olvidaré.» — Ella translates: \"I won't forget it.\" A grin breaks through, quick and warm."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "«Eres buena persona.» — Ella translates: \"You're a good person.\" You tap your chest, then theirs. Us. They nod, emphatic."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "You listen hard, watching their mouth shape the words. «¿Cuántos días llevamos aquí?» — Ella translates: \"How many days have we been here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "«¿Dónde se duerme aquí?» — Ella translates: \"Where does one sleep here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "Ignacio laughs — with you, mostly. \"Good try! Again — Eso mismo. Diste en el clavo..\" They walk you through it, patient as sunrise."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 22,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  }
 ],
