     "💛 You hold Knife roll. The dinner rush, the pass, the tickets coming faster than thought. You survived your first Saturday service at sixteen. The roll was the prize. Your gifts are not mastered — bu"
    ],
    "rumorSample": [],
    "crisisSample": [
     "◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Devon — Strange 1. Three offers; they took Pocket Sand. Earned, chosen. (pocket_sand: villager level-up)",
     "🕯️ Dorothy Berger is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
    ]
   }
  }
